.TH start-cli-volumes 1  "volumes "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-volumes \- Commands for managing shared volumes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli volumes\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Commands for managing shared volumes
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
start\-cli\-volumes\-create(1)
Create a shared volume
.TP
start\-cli\-volumes\-inspect(1)
Check a shared volume\*(Aqs availability and free space
.TP
start\-cli\-volumes\-list(1)
List shared volumes
.TP
start\-cli\-volumes\-remove(1)
Remove a shared volume; deletes the data of a local volume
.TP
start\-cli\-volumes\-rename(1)
Rename a shared volume
.TP
start\-cli\-volumes\-set\-grant(1)
Grant or revoke a package\*(Aqs access to a shared volume
.TP
start\-cli\-volumes\-update\-cifs(1)
Update the connection details of a CIFS shared volume
